# .gitignore — websites repo (static site, no build, no secrets)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing in this repo needs a secret. If that ever changes, the secret goes
# in the hosting dashboard (Netlify/GitHub settings), NEVER in a file here.

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Editors / OS
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db

# Node — only if you ever add the optional Tailwind compile step (SETUP.md).
# The starter itself needs no Node at all. (package.json / package-lock.json
# are intentionally NOT ignored: if the compile step is added, pinning the
# lockfile is what keeps the build reproducible.)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Build outputs (only if the optional compile step is added later)
dist/
.css-output/

# Local preview / test artefacts
*.log
lighthouse-reports/

# MotionSites licence: the skill is MIT, but examples/ and media/ are
# © MotionSites — they must NEVER be pushed to a public repo or resold.
# Excluded here so a public push cannot carry them by accident.
skills/motionsites-web-builder/examples/
skills/motionsites-web-builder/media/
